# -------------------------------------------------------------------
# third_party/ vendored upstream libraries
#
# Each subdirectory of third_party/ is a verbatim copy of an upstream
# project, retaining its own copyright and license.  The stanzas
# below enumerate every vendored component compiled into the shipped
# binaries.  Components that are not compiled into the package
# (header-only files used only at compile time, benchmark-only code,
# unenabled extensions) are still licensed but not shipped as code
# in the binary packages -- they are present in the source package.
# -------------------------------------------------------------------

