License: Expat

Files: third_party/catch/*
Copyright: 2010-2021 Two Blue Cubes Ltd. and contributors
License: BSL-1.0
Comment:
 Catch2 v2.13.7 single-include header.  Source distributes under the
 Boost Software License 1.0 per the per-file banner in
 third_party/catch/catch.hpp; no separate LICENSE file is vendored
 because the upstream single-header release is the LICENSE+code in
 one file.

