Copyright: 2012 Art.sy, Inc.
License: Expat

Files: third_party/imdb/*
Copyright: 2018-2026 Stichting DuckDB Foundation
License: Expat
Comment:
 DuckDB-authored benchmark loader for the IMDb JOB benchmark dataset.
 The dataset itself (which is NOT vendored in this source tree) has
 its own licensing from the IMDb project.  Only the loader code is
 in third_party/imdb/; it is used solely by benchmark_runner and is
 NOT compiled into the shipped libduckdb.so or duckdb CLI.

